  man I know John Dean Nixon's White House  Counsel and the survivor of presidential  scandals past to translate what  coordinating could mean to the director  of the FBI coordinating with the  National Security Division of just  Department headquarters could mean  almost anything but coordinating with  the office of the US attorney in the  Eastern District of Virginia John Dean  says commis testimony makes it difficult  to believe that there is not a grand  jury in the Eastern District of Virginia  a grand jury would obviously be one  reason the FBI would be coordinating  with the US attorney there right after  Comey added credence to Taylor's tweet  from April 28th Taylor acting as a kind  of citizen journalist took this whole  thing to get another higher level I now  have two sources within legal community  confirming that a DC area judge has  signed two warrants related to commis  trump investigation warrants search  warrants or arrest warrants taylor's  sources are not certain they believe  there are at least two sealed warrants  those sources are also pointing to the  fact that the reported grand jury in the  Eastern District of Virginia would be  under the jurisdiction of the US  Attorney for that region dana buente  until last month dana buente was the  Acting Deputy Attorney General of the  United States after the firing of Sally  Yates but Taylor's sources now add that  for months  beau wente has maintained a strict  quarantine against any contact with the  Attorney General mr. sessions mr.  sessions has recused himself from the  Trump Russia story because sessions was  not honest during his confirmation  hearing about his own contact with the  Russians Taylor's sources say in short  that on the subjects of general Flynn  and Trump and Russia buente no longer  reports to attorney General Sessions and  is essentially operating independently  and Taylor's sources also report that  the target list in the FBI investigation  of Trump and Russia ranges between 28  and 42 different individuals in any  event what Taylor has apparently  unearthed what Comey has said what other  independent investigators like Louie's  bench and John Schindler and Rick Wilson  and many others have alleged is if it is  corroborated so far ahead of the  so-called professional journalists that  it almost cannot be quantified Taylor  even seems to have a handle on the  nature of the cases to grand juries to  cases he tweeted one is a RICO case Rico  - tearing the other is a Farah foreign  agents Registration Act case the Farah  case loops in the Russians in Trump  Tower is larger and also does involve  Rico the other unrelated RICO case  involves no election matters it involves  money laundering as a predicate offense  so in short man named Claude Taylor  tweets there are two Trump Russia grand  juries five days later James Comey says  his FBI is coordinating with the US  Attorney's Office for the Eastern  District of Virginia on Trump and Russia  FBI coordination with the US Attorney's  Office could very well mean getting  evidence and testimony seen and heard by  a grand jury no hyperbole is needed here  a federal grand jury perhaps more than  one of them quite likely actively  investigating right now what links  existed between Trump's presidential  campaign and the Russians the FBI in its  directors own words coordinating with  the office of the US attorney in whose  district that grand jury apparently sits  and from Claude Taylor's sources the FBI  target list on Trump and Russia  reportedly includes at least 28 names  and as many as 42 names these are the  most important events in the  investigation of Trump and Russia since  the day of the presidential election  resist peace

